# RFC Process

This directory contains Request for Comments (RFCs) that document major design decisions and architectural changes to the DistribAI system.

## RFC Process

1. **Draft**: Create RFC with `draft-` prefix
2. **Review**: Community review period (minimum 7 days)
3. **Approval**: Core team approval required
4. **Implementation**: Implement approved RFC
5. **Archive**: Move to accepted RFCs

## RFC Template

```markdown
# RFC-XXX: [Title]

## Status
Draft | Review | Accepted | Implemented | Rejected

## Abstract
Brief summary of the proposal

## Motivation
Why this change is needed

## Specification
Detailed technical specification

## Security Considerations
Security impact analysis

## Implementation Plan
Step-by-step implementation guide

```

## Current RFCs

See individual RFC files for detailed specifications.